OL,3,GNEWSARower delighted after 'declare as
OL,4,ABritish' U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Irish rowing champion who was told
OL,7,Fhe could only compete and receive a
OL,8,Franking in the British Rowing Indoor
OL,9,FChampionships (BRIC) if he declares
OL,10,Fhimself as British can now compete as
OL,11,Fan Irish entrant.
OL,13,FDaniel Collins, who is based in
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland, competed in last
OL,15,Fyear's event under the Irish flag, but
OL,16,Frules changed for the 2026 event as the
OL,17,FBRIC and the World Rowing Indoor
OL,18,FChampionships (WRIC) are being run
OL,19,Fconcurrently.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
