OL,3,GNEWSARower delighted after 'declare as
OL,4,ABritish' U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FCollins said he has now received an
OL,7,Fapology from British Rowing and been
OL,8,Ftold that due to his citizenship
OL,9,Fstatus, he is eligible to appear in
OL,10,Fboth the British and World rankings.
OL,12,FBBC News NI has contacted British
OL,13,FRowing for a response.
